<title>USA: Peekskill to buy back 5pct of stock.</title>
<headline>Peekskill to buy back 5pct of stock.</headline>
<dateline>PEEKSKILL, N.Y. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peekskill Financial Corp said Thursday it wil repurchase up to five percent of its common stock.  The shares will be purchased on the open market, said the company, before Dec 29.</p>
<p>It is the fifth time Peekskill has undertaken a stock repurchase program since going public at the end of 1995.</p>
